{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "20ddb58ad05bd0490b9830da1234f13b74a7f46e383170312b1ea20dc6ea9525", "ja": "Smallフレンズ○", "zh": "Small Friends○", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7805c139ae920b61169074a5fe1013256fad856a3466f6aee67720782808d9a2", "ja": "先に行った亜美と昴は、子供達とドッジボー\nルをしていた。混ざって遊ぶプロデューサー\nとこのみ。子供達から、この区画は老朽化の\nため近々取り壊される事を聞く。思い出の場\n所がなくなると聞き、少し寂しそうな亜美。", "zh": "先行一步的亚美和昴正在和孩子们玩躲避球。\n制作人和好美也加入了他们的游戏。\n孩子们说，这个区域因为年久失修，过不了多久就要被拆除了。\n听说充满回忆的地方要消失，亚美显得有些寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "26f63da47a4cd43744bff181e4a671484861523d95f51e5550eb9a36f612116d", "ja": "（アスレチックの超難関コースに、亜美達の姿は\nなかった……じゃあ、一体どこに？）", "zh": "（在体能训练场的超高难度路线里，没有看到亚美她们的身影……那么，她们到底去哪儿了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "3853eeb3fa7d84ed62a97802adbbaddba090a67a25b549ffbfbbd3dbbc387bb9", "ja": "おかしいわねえ。\nみんな、どこに行っちゃったのかしら……。", "zh": "真奇怪呢。\n大家到底跑到哪里去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "0e2d21c1d660976d5bad9076f18f20b3d498dd6b69646df2ebe26d9eab66ce4d", "ja": "あら？　ねえ、{$P$}。\nあれ、亜美ちゃんたちじゃない？　ほら、あそこ！", "zh": "咦？喂，{$P$}。\n那不是亚美她们吗？你看，在那边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "304361c092c3721f997ad1d7718f67749f811e81a78e37246ef0eb52d46c325f", "ja": "えっ？　あ、本当ですね！\n子供達に囲まれて……何をやってるんだろう？", "zh": "咦？啊，真的呢！\n被孩子们围着……她们在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "278ea083cc8f9915f78efec5216ce0ee11d1874cfd55db9c1ac694a95627c6e8", "ja": "あれって……ドッジボールじゃないかしら？", "zh": "那个……是不是在玩躲避球啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1005_kodomotati2", "source_sha256": "6c56bee5c2ec11274ed8c67e0fe5c40926da5d1c1d43a16b11ad4278b0479eeb", "ja": "ワーワー！　いっけー！", "zh": "哇——！冲啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "e4ec81226b5babb0d049503432070052db3efd29dba486670a051d5e9cfb12b3", "ja": "うあうあ～、ちょびっとピンチかも？\nもう亜美と昴くんしか残ってないよ～。", "zh": "呜哇呜哇～，好像有点不妙了？\n已经只剩下亚美和昴啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1007_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "9f01d298539d9edef4435c8b96d02c853edf2d098a076582e55f99a7e7dea94b", "ja": "ご、ごめんね、亜美ちゃん、昴ちゃん。\nボクたち、足手まといになっちゃって……。", "zh": "对、对不起，亚美、昴。\n我们反而成了累赘……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "244b1c7020b4e4dcbb0ecac86f9fb5746202dadfdf4fcf5766ed0d920c8d5edc", "ja": "気にすんなって！\n勝負は、9回裏までわかんないんだからさ。", "zh": "别在意啦！胜负不到第9局下半场，谁也说不准嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1009_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "b3d33c01a80bc720a6c15e84aea4613f9c2a1c34f7811803c2868e4e80d6f61e", "ja": "う、うん！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "0a5ac660b1667c7e93c7d5d89a177091ac7c83567e617919fa154f9763f95153", "ja": "あっ、昴くん、気を付けてっ！\n敵チームがボール持ったよ！", "zh": "啊，昂，小心！\n对方球队拿到球了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1011_tekitimunootokonoko", "source_sha256": "bb045e5de178f822c9c7931395fc0c108cfcdfbb8188749e5894aa0cd7f37f81", "ja": "おせーよ、くらえーっ！", "zh": "你太慢了，接招——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1012_se", "source_sha256": "af3846f6dd94e7e07d6f389acb020f5ea2049e0efbcdc6718f2ca653f6ea7962", "ja": "バシッ！", "zh": "啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1013_tekitimunootokonoko", "source_sha256": "db89f12420434352b2239946b62fbb25d0bf89048bf679ff5a16e5cd65bed287", "ja": "あっ、取られた！？", "zh": "啊，被抢走了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "8795c211e3e5350c4d4472de7fdd4fae9755dce677cb3311016eedf3e0fed55e", "ja": "へへっ、野球ならストライクだったな♪\nよーし亜美、反撃開始といこうぜ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，要是棒球的话，刚才那球就是好球♪  \n好啦，亚美，开始反击吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "67201e2fc548c2a54e366e5b8e607f099f0c8a7e5b75c71df3c484d9a536bab0", "ja": "んっふっふ～、オッケー♪　亜美たちのおそろしさ、\nお腹いっぱい、味わっていきな！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～，好嘞♪ 让你吃饱喝足地好好领教一下，亜美我们的厉害吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1016_kodomotati2", "source_sha256": "5791df494dcd5ed00bcbf0b36109a4a44de34251258c65e0260159a2c7b4155d", "ja": "ワーワー！　ギャー！？", "zh": "哇——！　呀——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "c57108a8348f140da57b4ee298143d3c99197ce9f74612cd0e08b9088db4874e", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさま。\n大活躍だったわね、ふたりで逆転しちゃうなんて。", "zh": "两位都辛苦了。\n表现得非常出色呢，居然两个人一起实现了逆转。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "f061b47413d97e2d55f12fce85be29b17f8e208e09c19a1e7ddaf1bf08e8ce4a", "ja": "あっ、このみんと兄ちゃんだ！\nやっほっほ～♪", "zh": "啊，是好美亲和哥哥！\n嗨嗨～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "57892176779361bbad6e536dbd7784178359765e7e4bbe695af1d40e50f19d64", "ja": "{$P$}、大丈夫か？\nもう休んでなくて平気なの？", "zh": "{$P$}，没事吧？\n已经不用再休息了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d803ac70cd7f54102246703142578e656498596c7931cca48cfc1b8d886d9a15", "ja": "ああ、もう大丈夫だよ。\nところで、茜はどこに行ったんだ？", "zh": "啊，已经没事了。\n对了，茜去哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "83b4cfcca218b9c69984f1e72fb1bbe371bb3fd78bb6fe3ebe9eccf73c1c5d5b", "ja": "茜ちんは、ローラースケートやりに行ったよ！\n「茜ちゃん、風になるから！」だって。", "zh": "茜亲去玩轮滑了！\n她说：“要变成小茜，乘风而行！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1022_tekitimunootokonoko", "source_sha256": "0b72af112e221ebf2bd968172d431a49e2772ebc35a6e4fed3e0bf466c4a8fbe", "ja": "なあなあ、昴ー！　ドッジボールで変化球って、\nどうやるんだよ……って、誰だ？　そいつら。", "zh": "喂喂，昴！躲避球里的变化球要怎么投啊……等等，那些家伙是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "8aa34c1dfee84bde732bbe39b8238e4b684fc80a1b58f29a665326b1dc8d0ee3", "ja": "こんにちは、ボウヤ♪\nお姉さんたちはね、亜美ちゃんと昴ちゃんのお友達よ。", "zh": "你好呀，小弟弟♪  \n姐姐们呢，是亚美和昴的朋友哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1024_tekitimunootokonoko", "source_sha256": "8b0092996fe7ba02b189bc8f6178da4c5ec4d0a0402d7e767bc29a65ae9bc5c0", "ja": "ふーん……オマエ、どこ小？\n遊びたいなら、仲間に入れてやってもいいけど。", "zh": "嗯……你是哪个小学的？\n\n要是想一起玩，我倒也可以让你加入。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "d26613feccad802237981c302ad685bb03b5835aa5869cdbd2bffc6dafc21115", "ja": "どこ小……はあっ！？　わ、私は小学生じゃないわよ！\nセクシーなレディーなのっ、ムキーッ！", "zh": "哪所小学……哈！？我、我才不是小学生呢！我是性感的淑女啦，气死我了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b15d605bffc51e6f0b22fb81dadf27a63d9fce698db13dcf11fab49fc16bc44b", "ja": "まあまあ、このみさん。\n悪気はないみたいですし……。", "zh": "好啦好啦，木实。\n对方好像也没有恶意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "b2bff7d0bd560a543330b22c776e89288240a77d0f0b6a701d72c40303b47a0a", "ja": "んじゃさ、次は{$P$}と\nこのみも入れて、鬼ごっこしようぜ！", "zh": "那接下来，带上{$P$}和\n木实，大家一起玩捉迷藏吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1028_kodomotati2", "source_sha256": "2cefb20aa6da2a09e1dc81a47e0a4ef29ae312b8e57121d1836765eac8394236", "ja": "さんせーい！", "zh": "赞成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "5cbafbe976aac6e399969089586e03f03dfc5526aa392c30f4aa76aa15e7c775", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……見てなさい！　こうなったら私が、\n大人の強さを思い知らせてあげるんだから！", "zh": "唔唔……你给我等着！既然这样，我就让你见识一下大人的厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "2af137a2e36385e6affe8a2a5e8eaf754092cfbf9a50ab50f3a2b364a59ddc8a", "ja": "いやー、遊んだ遊んだ！\nメッチャ楽しかったっしょ～？　兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "哎呀～，玩得好尽兴啊！\n超级开心的吧～？哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5e9c59b27838b10bd4f1bbbb7b44e24a02c925debb2b3365857d9d622969e5bc", "ja": "あ、ああ……。\nハァ、ハァ……ウグッ……。", "zh": "啊，啊啊……\n哈、哈……呜呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "c123f6f4e48db2b7ec4811783cded50e343323c86d4798bfee81a91f48ca1356", "ja": "ああっ、また{$P$}が！？", "zh": "啊，又是{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1033_011ami", "source_sha256": "5bcfba1fd855a2482f248acafbcaf70b7e4a32fcdd0df5757f823a8ca83c4fca", "ja": "兄ちゃん、大丈夫？\nトシガイもなく無理するからだよー。", "zh": "哥哥，没事吧？\n谁让你不顾年纪硬撑呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1034_047sub", "source_sha256": "123732e0fd2b988649e87c938d23454b3efbfa957ffd3f6d3be0680b8cd24b76", "ja": "そうだよ{$P$}、ムリすんなって！\nほら、水！", "zh": "就是嘛，{$P$}，别勉强自己！\n给，水！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_1035", "source_sha256": "784ed17cba5bc922577849848430662ee647b74645369a3f6c345c7fefde23e8", "ja": "水を受け取る", "zh": "接收水", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "bf40859e0a1454e9098783a4f4a4f991f5e6dc4c57b39f4c2a3e93a367adaea5", "ja": "ゴクッゴクッ……ハァ。\nふぅ……ありがとう、昴。生き返ったよ。", "zh": "咕嘟咕嘟……哈。\n呼……谢谢你，昴。我活过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2001_011ami", "source_sha256": "353f8bd972d6204a155ee351cc7a6b7e38f89f7458fda6aa63d89ad5f4c34517", "ja": "兄ちゃん、張り切ってたもんね～。\n外で遊ぶのが、そんなに楽しかったの？", "zh": "哥哥刚才干劲十足嘛～  \n在外面玩有那么开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2002_p", "source_sha256": "1cc9f5f6a7f399b6ba228e5d5067d99e7f54158a4040bfbaa663f1854e04e9f9", "ja": "そうだな……なんだか、懐かしかったよ。\nたまには、こういう遊びもいいもんだな。", "zh": "是啊……总觉得，很怀念。\n偶尔玩玩这种游戏也挺不错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2003_039kon", "source_sha256": "36d09f237ae4d3d7d89e92666ae2f2a4f6295c8b3f703713133172086030c2b0", "ja": "そうそう、懐かしいって言えば、この公園よね。\n年季が入ってるっていうか、古いっていうか……。", "zh": "对对，说到怀旧，就要数这个公园了。该说是很有年头，还是说很旧呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2004_011ami", "source_sha256": "07e63fa93eeadecc9b3e83d938eea3d42e658a2f56b5c333874ca9057e24cda7", "ja": "このみん、そのとーりっ！\nここは、亜美たちが小さいころからある公園なんだよ。", "zh": "没错没错，这正是如此，小此木！\n这里可是从亚美她们还小的时候就存在的公园哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2005_039kon", "source_sha256": "45ac0ce693cc716290f7080545f72812dcbf08db00502cb9e0ea1273fdbde017", "ja": "え？　でも亜美ちゃん、ミリオンパークって、\n最近できたんじゃなかった？", "zh": "咦？可是，亚美，你不是说百万公园是最近才建成的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2006_011ami", "source_sha256": "32e47e026d87c2a061562757e9450b2088efd116fe7b9f02e3c744b36b193264", "ja": "うん。ここは前から公園だったんだけど。最近、\n公園の周り全部がミリオンパークになったんだよ。", "zh": "嗯。虽然这里以前就是公园，不过最近\n公园周围全都变成了百万公园哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2007_011ami", "source_sha256": "9db8e291c60b823e9463ce0521dd1cbdf7df843afe90bfc878ddb955d87ab300", "ja": "亜美も真美も、小さいころはいっつも\nこの公園で遊んでたからね♪", "zh": "亚美和真美小时候经常在这个公园里玩呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2008_p", "source_sha256": "b28690750fc13a8d54ae7571115136eff407579148a677bd54edcb82661d810f", "ja": "なるほど、パークの敷地内に古い公園がそのまま\n残してあるのか……どうりで、雰囲気が違うわけだ。", "zh": "原来如此，公园园区里还保留着一座原本的老公园……难怪感觉和别处不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2009_tekitimunootokonoko", "source_sha256": "64e5c84b48047a7dad5c5a6619c6bcdf253fd130637fc6342e268b024e7c07f1", "ja": "でもここ、もうすぐ壊しちゃうんだって……。", "zh": "不过，听说这里很快就要被拆掉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2010_011ami", "source_sha256": "2901c61dca2c19647568b01df56506c1cb8ddf263135764b2d52d768aff695a7", "ja": "ええっ、そうなの！？\n亜美、聞いてないよ！？", "zh": "诶诶，是这样的吗！？\n人家都没听说过啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2011_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "1eadf063d9bc638a701e7c72b46048cb94ff5bff6011b7cb1d30c4ef89a33b8f", "ja": "うん。ろうきゅう化っていうのが進んで、\n危ないからだって。お母さんが言ってた……。", "zh": "嗯。妈妈说……是因为老旧化越来越严重，\n太危险了才这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2012_039kon", "source_sha256": "aa29f607a458d1c3489c94b71933abf6f430659ff5966a0c52e5492757cf8872", "ja": "そうなの……残念ね、亜美ちゃん。\n思い出のある公園なのに……。", "zh": "这样啊……真遗憾呢，亚美。\n明明是个充满回忆的公园……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2013_011ami", "source_sha256": "7237c95bda782ee7c78943e81803742b9314a338f15242f721ef6b7b6d3a6f41", "ja": "うーん、そっか……。でも仕方ないよ、このみん！\nこれも、時代の流れってヤツですな～！", "zh": "嗯——这样啊……不过也没办法啦，木实姐！这也是时代发展的潮流嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_03_2014_p", "source_sha256": "5c3dd5fd5bd8acaf9d23574c0e54af7bddc9528ab227e3ae35e059a3e88e31d6", "ja": "（亜美はそう言いながらも、ちょっと寂しそうだった。\n思い出の場所がなくなるんだ、無理もないな……）", "zh": "（亚美虽然嘴上这么说，表情却有些寂寞。毕竟回忆中的地方要消失了……这也难怪。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
